<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to FIFTH SENSE PERFUMES</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f9faf6; padding: 40px 20px;">
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #edeeeb;">
